WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.849
An equation tells a story about equal quantities. Check that the operation and

00:00:04.849 --> 00:00:06.280
unknown match the story.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:13.986
Find x in x minus 3 equals 11. The answer is 14. Add 3 to both sides; x equals 14.

00:00:13.986 --> 00:00:17.421
You can also tell a story that matches the equation.

00:00:18.283 --> 00:00:24.479
A volunteer at a market stall had an unknown number x of flyers, gave away 8 and had

00:00:24.479 --> 00:00:28.609
16 remaining. Which equation models the story? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:35.924
A volunteer at a market stall had an unknown number x of flyers, gave away 8 and had

00:00:35.924 --> 00:00:41.320
16 remaining. Which equation models the story? The answer is x minus 8 equals 16.

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:44.917
Giving away 8 means subtracting: x minus 8 equals 16.
